Create a menu-driven Python application where a user can perform different activities:

1 Login
2 Calculate
3 Read a File
4 Write a File
5 Logout

Generate logs for
DEBUG
INFO
WARNING
ERROR
CRITICAL

For example
INFO User logged in
INFO Calculation completed
WARNING File was empty
ERROR File could not be opened
CRITICAL Unexpected application failure
Store logs inside

logs/
application.log
error.log

Use exception handling so that an error in one operation does not terminate the entire application.
Separate the application into multiple modules instead of writing everything in main.py.

Sample Input:
Provide the options when keyboard is expecitng input from user

Sample Output:
